1
00:00:41,634 --> 00:00:44,774
Kobato.

2
00:00:44,774 --> 00:00:47,614
Kobato.
Dou sureba iin dakke?

3
00:00:47,614 --> 00:00:52,014
Kobato.
Atarimae no kototte itsumo

4
00:00:52,914 --> 00:00:56,214
Muzukashii na

5
00:00:56,214 --> 00:00:58,984
Ureshii toki waratte

6
00:00:58,984 --> 00:01:03,284
Suki na toki ni utaitai dake

7
00:01:03,864 --> 00:01:06,294
Na no ni

8
00:01:07,594 --> 00:01:11,964
Itsuka negai wa kanau to

9
00:01:12,404 --> 00:01:15,674
Demo "itsuka" tte dore kurai?

10
00:01:15,674 --> 00:01:19,164
Machikirenai yo

11
00:01:19,304 --> 00:01:25,084
123! no aizu de ryoute hirogete

12
00:01:25,084 --> 00:01:30,284
Zenshin ni hikari wo atsumete

13
00:01:30,284 --> 00:01:33,124
Doko ni aru no?

14
00:01:33,124 --> 00:01:36,454
Oshiete, watashi ni dekiru koto

15
00:01:36,454 --> 00:01:39,294
Meippai kizu tsuite

16
00:01:39,294 --> 00:01:42,194
Seiippai hashitte

17
00:01:42,194 --> 00:01:46,164
Nan juu kai koronde naite

18
00:01:46,164 --> 00:01:49,204
Sore de mo mada

19
00:01:49,204 --> 00:01:53,234
Akireru kurai

20
00:01:53,714 --> 00:01:57,874
Ashita wo shinjiteru

21
00:02:07,624 --> 00:02:12,454
...Day to Say Goodbye.

22
00:02:14,634 --> 00:02:16,034
Kobato.

23
00:02:17,164 --> 00:02:19,394
What are you laughing in your sleep about?

24
00:02:19,664 --> 00:02:22,934
Huh? Was I laughing?

25
00:02:23,074 --> 00:02:26,234
With that smile, you looked like the
happiest person in the world.

26
00:02:26,474 --> 00:02:28,714
Must have been a good dream.

27
00:02:28,714 --> 00:02:30,234
Oh, yes!

28
00:02:31,114 --> 00:02:32,474
A long time ago...

29
00:02:34,484 --> 00:02:35,814
Huh?

30
00:02:37,484 --> 00:02:38,954
Um...

31
00:02:42,524 --> 00:02:46,984
It was a very happy dream.

32
00:02:49,764 --> 00:02:52,364
It was a dream about the place
you wish to go to, wasn't it?

33
00:02:53,334 --> 00:02:54,424
Huh?

34
00:03:27,304 --> 00:03:31,234
Notice of Kindergarten Closure
We hereby give notice that this kindergarten is
no longer in operation. We truly apologize for
any inconveniences this may cause. Should you
wish to make an inquiry in relation to this
closure, please contact the principal, Sayaka Okiura.
Sayaka Okiura
Yomogi Kindergarten

35
00:03:31,304 --> 00:03:35,204
Thank you
Goodbye, Yomogi Kindergarten

36
00:03:55,564 --> 00:03:56,994
Good morning!

37
00:03:58,904 --> 00:04:00,424
Good morning, Kobato.

38
00:04:00,804 --> 00:04:02,864
What shall we tidy up today?

39
00:04:07,944 --> 00:04:09,504
I'm off work now.

40
00:04:09,914 --> 00:04:11,844
Yeah. See you.

41
00:04:17,424 --> 00:04:19,944
Pretty hard work, isn't it?
There are so many of them.

42
00:04:20,194 --> 00:04:22,784
I'm fine! I can still work hard!

43
00:04:23,324 --> 00:04:27,024
You're right. In order to renew,
we need to get rid of the old.

44
00:04:28,334 --> 00:04:30,094
Get rid of the old...

45
00:04:36,834 --> 00:04:39,534
Let's take the ones that have
been bound out front.

46
00:04:39,704 --> 00:04:41,004
Yes.

47
00:04:48,084 --> 00:04:50,054
Let's have a tea break when
we're done with this.

48
00:04:50,454 --> 00:04:51,974
Uh... Okay!

49
00:04:52,724 --> 00:04:55,454
It's kind of tough without
Fujimoto's help, isn't it?

50
00:04:56,224 --> 00:04:59,854
He's busy with work, isn't he?

51
00:05:05,064 --> 00:05:06,624
Thank you very much.

52
00:05:13,274 --> 00:05:16,074
You know, you don't have to push yourself
by taking on additional shifts.

53
00:05:16,474 --> 00:05:18,374
No. Please put me in.

54
00:05:18,914 --> 00:05:21,214
But you don't have to earn so
much anymore, do you?

55
00:05:21,654 --> 00:05:23,774
If you're firing me, please say so.

56
00:05:23,954 --> 00:05:26,824
No, you're not fired! That's not it at all!

57
00:05:28,494 --> 00:05:30,754
You don't understand, do you?

58
00:05:35,594 --> 00:05:36,724
I'm sorry.

59
00:05:38,404 --> 00:05:40,594
I'm sorry for deciding to quit the kindergarten.

60
00:05:41,404 --> 00:05:42,304
Huh?

61
00:05:43,104 --> 00:05:45,874
But I need you to understand this.

62
00:05:46,874 --> 00:05:49,844
Right now, I feel that it was the best decision.

63
00:05:52,944 --> 00:05:54,784
I don't regret it.

64
00:05:55,254 --> 00:05:57,484
I did it not because of what Okiura told me.

65
00:05:58,084 --> 00:06:00,614
In the end it was my decision.

66
00:06:02,124 --> 00:06:03,684
That's how I feel.

67
00:06:05,924 --> 00:06:07,224
Yes.

68
00:06:24,784 --> 00:06:26,044
What is it?

69
00:06:26,044 --> 00:06:29,284
Um, would you please drop
by the kindergarten once?

70
00:06:30,084 --> 00:06:33,554
Because, um... there are still things
there that belong to you and...

71
00:06:33,554 --> 00:06:34,484
No.
Because, um... there are still things
there that belong to you and...

72
00:06:36,224 --> 00:06:38,364
Feel free to throw it all away.

73
00:06:38,364 --> 00:06:39,094
But...

74
00:06:39,094 --> 00:06:39,624
I'm too busy to go.
But...

75
00:06:39,624 --> 00:06:40,754
I'm too busy to go.

76
00:06:52,774 --> 00:06:55,304
For pedestrians and bicycles

77
00:07:04,624 --> 00:07:09,424
Oh, Fujimoto here. I'm afraid I'm
going to be about an hour late.

78
00:07:55,034 --> 00:07:56,624
Fujimoto?

79
00:08:39,314 --> 00:08:40,804
Watch where you're going!

80
00:08:50,764 --> 00:08:51,814
Huh?

81
00:08:51,964 --> 00:08:53,954
I heard you were going to be late today.

82
00:08:55,134 --> 00:08:56,894
I was finished earlier than I thought.

83
00:09:13,744 --> 00:09:16,274
Get that long look off of your face.

84
00:09:16,614 --> 00:09:19,414
You're even making me depressed.

85
00:09:21,224 --> 00:09:23,084
I'm sorry.

86
00:09:25,024 --> 00:09:26,894
What are you thinking about?

87
00:09:27,694 --> 00:09:29,064
What do you want to do?

88
00:09:31,434 --> 00:09:34,524
I'm not really sure, but...

89
00:09:35,204 --> 00:09:36,464
But?

90
00:09:38,604 --> 00:09:40,404
It hurts right here.

91
00:09:41,374 --> 00:09:43,974
Yomogi Kindergarten closed down,

92
00:09:44,984 --> 00:09:47,974
and it was a good thing for Ms. Sayaka.

93
00:09:49,014 --> 00:09:50,284
But still...

94
00:09:53,184 --> 00:09:55,084
Fujimoto, is it?

95
00:09:56,594 --> 00:09:59,784
What? Fujimoto?

96
00:10:00,294 --> 00:10:02,194
What kind of reaction is that?!

97
00:10:04,434 --> 00:10:05,954
Aren't you aware of your feelings?

98
00:10:08,634 --> 00:10:11,434
Oh, brother. I don't believe it.

99
00:10:33,934 --> 00:10:35,394
Fujimoto?

100
00:10:36,094 --> 00:10:37,364
Good morning.

101
00:10:37,664 --> 00:10:39,104
Are you working today, too?

102
00:10:39,164 --> 00:10:40,304
Yes I am.

103
00:10:40,304 --> 00:10:43,834
But isn't today the day they're
taking the kindergarten down?

104
00:10:43,834 --> 00:10:45,134
I've got to go.

105
00:10:47,974 --> 00:10:50,104
He could have at least taken today off.

106
00:10:51,644 --> 00:10:52,734
Well then.

107
00:10:52,884 --> 00:10:54,644
The next-door neighbor has gone out.

108
00:10:54,814 --> 00:10:56,404
I guess I'll be on my way too.

109
00:10:56,984 --> 00:10:58,544
Are you going somewhere?

110
00:10:58,824 --> 00:11:00,754
Yeah. I'll be back by night.

111
00:11:02,154 --> 00:11:04,184
Now get that look off of your face.

112
00:11:04,764 --> 00:11:05,594
Okay...

113
00:11:05,594 --> 00:11:06,724
Come on.

114
00:11:06,864 --> 00:11:09,164
You'd better hurry, too. You're going to be late.

115
00:11:09,164 --> 00:11:10,494
Y-Yes sir!

116
00:11:10,764 --> 00:11:11,204
Has the glass all been removed?

117
00:11:11,204 --> 00:11:12,234
Keep going, keep going, keep going...
Has the glass all been removed?

118
00:11:12,234 --> 00:11:13,364
Keep going, keep going, keep going...
Yes!

119
00:11:14,204 --> 00:11:15,394
Okay, stop!

120
00:11:17,274 --> 00:11:18,534
Good work, guys.

121
00:11:19,204 --> 00:11:21,334
Teacher, did you get your stuff out?

122
00:11:21,844 --> 00:11:24,074
We took everything out yesterday.

123
00:11:24,784 --> 00:11:27,804
So we can get to work now, can we?

124
00:11:28,454 --> 00:11:30,384
Where's that guy with the evil glare?

125
00:11:31,024 --> 00:11:32,184
He's gone to work.

126
00:11:32,384 --> 00:11:34,754
Why, that's awfully cold.

127
00:11:35,454 --> 00:11:38,354
I mean this place took good care of him.
He ought to show more respect.

128
00:11:38,594 --> 00:11:39,924
He is not cold!

129
00:11:42,194 --> 00:11:45,064
Fujimoto is a very busy person!

130
00:11:49,734 --> 00:11:52,134
Uh... Hey, I'm sorry.

131
00:11:52,904 --> 00:11:56,864
It's just that Mr. Okiura asked me to give
him a message. Thanking him and stuff.

132
00:11:58,084 --> 00:11:59,804
Says he can't come by for a while.

133
00:12:00,014 --> 00:12:02,054
Yes, he told me.

134
00:12:02,054 --> 00:12:03,154
Huh?

135
00:12:03,154 --> 00:12:05,714
I guess he had it in with the top.

136
00:12:06,154 --> 00:12:09,124
Though we guys at the bottom of the
ladder really have no idea what goes on.

137
00:12:09,794 --> 00:12:12,264
A-And how is Mr. Okiura?

138
00:12:12,364 --> 00:12:15,094
No worries. He'll do fine.

139
00:12:15,334 --> 00:12:17,094
After all, he is Mr. Okiura.

140
00:12:18,564 --> 00:12:20,394
Ms. Sayaka!

141
00:12:20,904 --> 00:12:22,304
Kobato.

142
00:12:22,304 --> 00:12:23,634
Everyone?!

143
00:12:23,734 --> 00:12:25,244
What's the matter?

144
00:12:25,244 --> 00:12:28,174
Well, today's the day to say goodbye, so...

145
00:12:28,174 --> 00:12:29,414
We came to see.

146
00:12:29,414 --> 00:12:32,284
I told my mother that I was coming here.

147
00:12:32,284 --> 00:12:34,614
Is that so? Thank you.

148
00:12:35,354 --> 00:12:37,614
Is it all right to begin now, boss?

149
00:12:38,724 --> 00:12:41,214
Teacher, can we start?

150
00:12:56,304 --> 00:12:57,774
Please go ahead.

151
00:12:58,874 --> 00:13:01,774
Okay now, let's move back so we don't get hurt.

152
00:13:01,774 --> 00:13:03,434
Okay!

153
00:13:03,874 --> 00:13:05,904
Okay, begin!

154
00:13:34,214 --> 00:13:35,734
Bye-bye.

155
00:13:44,824 --> 00:13:46,414
I'll say it again.

156
00:13:47,054 --> 00:13:49,044
That is a request that I cannot help you with.

157
00:13:52,864 --> 00:13:54,264
Give it up.

158
00:13:55,764 --> 00:13:57,034
Hey!

159
00:13:57,034 --> 00:13:59,394
Sir Genko, that's not fair.

160
00:13:59,464 --> 00:14:01,234
You all having your snacks before me.

161
00:14:01,234 --> 00:14:02,894
I'm having mine too!

162
00:14:03,874 --> 00:14:06,364
Zuisho, be quiet.

163
00:14:06,574 --> 00:14:08,204
Yes? Hm?

164
00:14:11,914 --> 00:14:15,504
What?! You're going to catch Ushagi-san?!

165
00:14:16,114 --> 00:14:20,384
That's right. We'll take Ushagi-san
hostage, and then persuade him.

166
00:14:20,724 --> 00:14:24,284
Do you seriously think "God" is
going to agree to a deal like that.

167
00:14:24,624 --> 00:14:26,824
It's better than not doing anything.

168
00:14:27,864 --> 00:14:31,894
It's not such a light contract, including
the present situation we're in.

169
00:14:32,604 --> 00:14:37,434
Ginsei is right. What he says is a lot
more practical than your ideas.

170
00:14:40,604 --> 00:14:42,474
It's not about how heavy or light things are.

171
00:14:42,474 --> 00:14:44,534
We can change that later, however we wish.

172
00:14:45,284 --> 00:14:49,414
Give me a break! Didn't you learn
anything from what we went through?

173
00:14:49,414 --> 00:14:51,214
Oh, the both of you!

174
00:14:51,384 --> 00:14:53,544
So you're planning to use force again, are you?

175
00:14:54,054 --> 00:14:57,954
Well, if you haven't figured out who it would hurt
the most, why don't I spell it out for you?!

176
00:15:02,264 --> 00:15:03,694
Sorry.

177
00:15:07,574 --> 00:15:08,964
Never mind.

178
00:15:09,134 --> 00:15:13,004
Perhaps what "God" was trying to
teach you was about waiting.

179
00:15:14,544 --> 00:15:17,544
Sure enough. That's one topic
I'm not very good at.

180
00:15:17,544 --> 00:15:18,704
Hey!

181
00:15:20,014 --> 00:15:22,604
I get the message. I won't do anything.

182
00:16:06,394 --> 00:16:11,094
My name is Iorogi. I will be
with you from now on.

183
00:16:27,014 --> 00:16:30,954
Teacher. When we're finished cleaning up,
entry will no longer be permitted.

184
00:16:31,354 --> 00:16:33,614
Yes. Thank you.

185
00:16:34,254 --> 00:16:36,984
Well then, teacher, you all take care now. Bye.

186
00:16:46,164 --> 00:16:50,964
I thought we had a lot of space,
but looking at it now...

187
00:16:52,844 --> 00:16:53,934
Right?

188
00:17:01,354 --> 00:17:04,344
Kobato, I'd like to ask you a favor.

189
00:17:04,724 --> 00:17:05,744
Do you mind?

190
00:17:07,224 --> 00:17:08,384
Yes?

191
00:17:08,954 --> 00:17:12,254
I'd like you to help Fujimoto.

192
00:17:12,724 --> 00:17:13,824
What?

193
00:17:14,934 --> 00:17:19,264
Yomogi Kindergarten may very
well have tied him down.

194
00:17:20,164 --> 00:17:21,654
I really think so.

195
00:17:22,004 --> 00:17:25,464
Tied him down... to what?

196
00:17:26,104 --> 00:17:30,544
I was counting on him to continue being
the hard working Fujimoto as always.

197
00:17:34,284 --> 00:17:37,444
I kept relying on him.

198
00:17:38,424 --> 00:17:42,254
I should have noticed much sooner for his sake.

199
00:17:46,194 --> 00:17:47,954
You're a great help, Fujimoto.

200
00:17:50,894 --> 00:17:52,164
Teacher Fujimoto!

201
00:17:52,164 --> 00:17:53,634
Play the organ for us!

202
00:18:05,984 --> 00:18:11,854
I should have told him to do what
he wanted to do, for himself.

203
00:18:12,324 --> 00:18:16,344
But no! Fujimoto was truly
just doing his best to...

204
00:18:17,454 --> 00:18:20,554
Yes. All the more reason why I should have.

205
00:18:21,394 --> 00:18:23,994
Because he's the type of person
who goes out of his way.

206
00:18:25,604 --> 00:18:29,904
So, Kobato, please do that for me.

207
00:18:30,734 --> 00:18:32,204
Stay by his side.

208
00:18:32,804 --> 00:18:34,634
But Ms. Sayaka you...

209
00:18:35,114 --> 00:18:37,304
That's not my job.

210
00:18:38,114 --> 00:18:40,374
Not anymore.

211
00:18:50,454 --> 00:18:51,754
Kobato!

212
00:18:52,194 --> 00:18:53,364
Kobato!

213
00:18:53,364 --> 00:18:55,154
Oh, hello. I'm back.

214
00:18:55,934 --> 00:18:56,934
Kobato!

215
00:18:56,934 --> 00:18:58,454
Something terrible has happened!

216
00:19:07,204 --> 00:19:09,264
Domoto, why did you?

217
00:19:10,644 --> 00:19:14,104
As promised, I didn't contact any of
Yomogi Kindergarten's personnel.

218
00:19:14,784 --> 00:19:16,544
But I did tell the landlady.

219
00:19:16,784 --> 00:19:17,754
Tch!

220
00:19:18,054 --> 00:19:19,414
Sorry Kobato.

221
00:19:19,884 --> 00:19:21,854
He didn't want to worry you.

222
00:19:22,524 --> 00:19:24,084
It's his way of being nice...

223
00:19:48,954 --> 00:19:50,914
Um, your arm.

224
00:19:54,854 --> 00:19:58,024
I-I'm glad you weren't hurt too badly.

225
00:19:58,764 --> 00:20:00,924
Please don't push yourself.

226
00:20:01,064 --> 00:20:02,534
Everyone will worry.

227
00:20:06,664 --> 00:20:09,064
It will be inconvenient not
being able to use one hand.

228
00:20:09,474 --> 00:20:12,204
Please let me know if there's
anything I can do for you.

229
00:20:19,714 --> 00:20:24,584
I did tell you that day we first met at
Yomogi Kindergarten, didn't I?

230
00:20:25,284 --> 00:20:26,414
Huh?

231
00:20:27,424 --> 00:20:29,784
That if it's out of sympathy
or curiosity, don't bother.

232
00:20:33,464 --> 00:20:37,294
If you're feeling sorry for me,
I want you to stop it.

233
00:20:38,104 --> 00:20:38,664
It's not like that!

234
00:20:38,664 --> 00:20:39,204
You're a nuisance!
It's not like that!

235
00:20:39,204 --> 00:20:40,094
You're a nuisance!

236
00:20:46,004 --> 00:20:48,134
No... Fujimo...

237
00:20:58,954 --> 00:21:00,114
No...

238
00:21:29,454 --> 00:21:31,814
Is this for me?

239
00:21:38,424 --> 00:21:39,414
Huh?

240
00:21:39,824 --> 00:21:43,324
He says you're to collect the
kompeito by the next full moon.

241
00:21:43,734 --> 00:21:48,664
Otherwise, your destination will be
determined according to the contract.

242
00:21:50,934 --> 00:21:52,204
Hey, Ushagi-san.

243
00:21:55,214 --> 00:21:57,334
How does one get an extension on that?!

244
00:21:59,644 --> 00:22:00,974
So what's going to happen from now?

245
00:22:01,714 --> 00:22:03,254
What do you think we should do?

246
00:22:03,254 --> 00:22:05,514
I don't know. It's up to him.

247
00:22:06,254 --> 00:22:09,314
One thing's for sure. He must
be feeling responsible.

248
00:22:09,824 --> 00:22:12,854
If it weren't for that battle,
she wouldn't have...

249
00:22:13,524 --> 00:22:19,094
...she wouldn't have been sucked into this,
and that wouldn't have happened.

250
00:22:20,604 --> 00:22:22,904
If there's anything I can do, I'll do it.

251
00:22:23,204 --> 00:22:26,194
So please, give us until
another four seasons pass.

252
00:22:26,574 --> 00:22:28,734
No... Just one will do!

253
00:22:30,344 --> 00:22:31,744
I'm begging you!

254
00:22:41,294 --> 00:22:43,014
You're saying "no"?!

255
00:22:44,294 --> 00:22:45,414
Hey!

256
00:23:01,974 --> 00:23:05,934
Nakushita mono to

257
00:23:07,914 --> 00:23:12,754
Atsumeta mono no hazama ni

258
00:23:13,754 --> 00:23:20,854
Anata no egao ochiteita no

259
00:23:21,464 --> 00:23:26,904
Todokisou de todokanai

260
00:23:28,074 --> 00:23:32,634
Tonde yukeru wake janai shi

261
